    "detailed_description": "<strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About</h2></strong><br>Gedaria is a <strong>2D adventure puzzle-platformer</strong>, from a Czech independent game developer team of two high school students. The game takes place in the past. You will take on a role of a peasant Vladimir, on the way to the liberation of his kidnapped family\u2026 The game will surely captivate you with its simple but beautiful autumn atmosphere and<strong> non-traditional game mechanics.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679880/extras/f00177a3474b11424597438a72b3e031.poster.avif?t=1671292802\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679880/extras/f00177a3474b11424597438a72b3e031.webm?t=1671292802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679880/extras/f00177a3474b11424597438a72b3e031.mp4?t=1671292802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Main Character</h2></strong><br>The main character Vladimir is the son of a farmer, an ordinary boy who finds a <strong>legendary rake</strong>, which gives him the ability to rake leaves into piles and solve puzzles across levels.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679880/extras/d7e42927da38bef2a3e0a9c3b740f057.poster.avif?t=1671292802\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679880/extras/d7e42927da38bef2a3e0a9c3b740f057.webm?t=1671292802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679880/extras/d7e42927da38bef2a3e0a9c3b740f057.mp4?t=1671292802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unique Mechanics</h2></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Piles of leaves,<br></li><li>leaf holders,<br></li><li>wind,<br></li><li>quick-leaves (quick sand made of leaves \ud83d\ude09),<br></li><li>leaves,<br></li><li>leaf blower.</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679880/extras/c7c31dc82d843f310d16ef1174a6ceac.poster.avif?t=1671292802\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679880/extras/c7c31dc82d843f310d16ef1174a6ceac.webm?t=1671292802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679880/extras/c7c31dc82d843f310d16ef1174a6ceac.mp4?t=1671292802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About</h2></strong><br>Gedaria is a <strong>2D adventure puzzle-platformer</strong>, from a Czech independent game developer team of two high school students. The game takes place in the past. You will take on a role of a peasant Vladimir, on the way to the liberation of his kidnapped family\u2026 The game will surely captivate you with its simple but beautiful autumn atmosphere and<strong> non-traditional game mechanics.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679880/extras/f00177a3474b11424597438a72b3e031.poster.avif?t=1671292802\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679880/extras/f00177a3474b11424597438a72b3e031.webm?t=1671292802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679880/extras/f00177a3474b11424597438a72b3e031.mp4?t=1671292802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Main Character</h2></strong><br>The main character Vladimir is the son of a farmer, an ordinary boy who finds a <strong>legendary rake</strong>, which gives him the ability to rake leaves into piles and solve puzzles across levels.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679880/extras/d7e42927da38bef2a3e0a9c3b740f057.poster.avif?t=1671292802\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679880/extras/d7e42927da38bef2a3e0a9c3b740f057.webm?t=1671292802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679880/extras/d7e42927da38bef2a3e0a9c3b740f057.mp4?t=1671292802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unique Mechanics</h2></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Piles of leaves,<br></li><li>leaf holders,<br></li><li>wind,<br></li><li>quick-leaves (quick sand made of leaves \ud83d\ude09),<br></li><li>leaves,<br></li><li>leaf blower.</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679880/extras/c7c31dc82d843f310d16ef1174a6ceac.poster.avif?t=1671292802\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679880/extras/c7c31dc82d843f310d16ef1174a6ceac.webm?t=1671292802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1679880/extras/c7c31dc82d843f310d16ef1174a6ceac.mp4?t=1671292802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "short_description": "Action 2D adventure game Solve puzzles using your legendary rake Rake leaves, form piles or destroy leaf-barrier Blow leaves away with wind or leaf blower, escape quicksand leaves, build your path with leaves and save the family",
    "supported_languages": "English, Czech, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Danish, Finnish, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Swedish",
    "reviews": "\u201cThe game will surley captivate you with its simple but beautiful autumn atmosphere\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 <br><br>\u201cIn this game you're equipped with just rakes! This is a welcome change from competing games and a completely unique concept of raking leaves   The visuals of the game look nice in the current phase and, together with the excellent soundtrack, significantly underline the fairytale atmosphere.   Gedaria is a charming adventure game that can entertain for several hours.\u201d<br>8/10 \u2013 INDIAN<br>",
